  "display_title": "It's Not Love",
  "description": "Soo-Yeon wants to marry her boyfriend of 6 years, Jung-Hyun, but everyone around her opposes her marriage to Jung-Hyun, who is selfish and only thinks about himself.\n\n *\"Why do you want to marry me?\"*\n\nSoo-Yeon asks Jung-Hyun, hoping to confirm his feelings, and he gives an unexpected answer. \n\n*\"My father is retiring soon, so I need to give back the wedding money he gave me before.\"*\n\nWhat!? That's why you want to marry me!? Her mind is confused for a moment, but she gets entangled with her successor, Do-Kyung...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
